{"4026510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lucid Falls", "steam_appid": 4026510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped inside a lucid dream, fight to survive in surreal, horrifying worlds, facing terrifying creatures, shifting gravity to navigate impossible spaces, and solving challenges that bend reality, as every moment pulls you closer to the dark truth behind Lucid Falls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate reality itself by altering gravity, space, and time to uncover hidden paths and solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026510/extras/7441dbbe03989db6cffbe0dd6ba4324d.poster.avif?t=1786979586\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026510/extras/7441dbbe03989db6cffbe0dd6ba4324d.webm?t=1786979586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026510/extras/7441dbbe03989db6cffbe0dd6ba4324d.mp4?t=1786979586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026510/extras/4793a69c9b827eff1e9f89ceca2a644e.poster.avif?t=1786979586\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026510/extras/4793a69c9b827eff1e9f89ceca2a644e.webm?t=1786979586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026510/extras/4793a69c9b827eff1e9f89ceca2a644e.mp4?t=1786979586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight and survive against terrifying, grotesque creatures born straight from hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026510/extras/03119d97607fa6b1b00882663b5a2231.poster.avif?t=1786979586\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026510/extras/03119d97607fa6b1b00882663b5a2231.webm?t=1786979586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It's Not Just Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is how the world feels, moves, and responds. Lucid Falls is all about mood. The atmosphere drives the entire experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026510/extras/85bf40b70dc6079c3eab16318f114e3f.poster.avif?t=1786979586\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026510/extras/85bf40b70dc6079c3eab16318f114e3f.webm?t=1786979586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cinematic Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic visuals and atmospheric environments bring nightmares to life, with grotesque creatures lurking in every shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026510/extras/dc5176e27d0cd4eb8087688fed8cf32a.poster.avif?t=1786979586\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026510/extras/dc5176e27d0cd4eb8087688fed8cf32a.webm?t=1786979586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped inside a lucid dream, fight to survive in surreal, horrifying worlds, facing terrifying creatures, shifting gravity to navigate impossible spaces, and solving challenges that bend reality, as every moment pulls you closer to the dark truth behind Lucid Falls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate reality itself by altering gravity, space, and time to uncover hidden paths and solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026510/extras/7441dbbe03989db6cffbe0dd6ba4324d.poster.avif?t=1786979586\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026510/extras/7441dbbe03989db6cffbe0dd6ba4324d.webm?t=1786979586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026510/extras/7441dbbe03989db6cffbe0dd6ba4324d.mp4?t=1786979586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026510/extras/4793a69c9b827eff1e9f89ceca2a644e.poster.avif?t=1786979586\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026510/extras/4793a69c9b827eff1e9f89ceca2a644e.webm?t=1786979586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026510/extras/4793a69c9b827eff1e9f89ceca2a644e.mp4?t=1786979586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic Combat</strong></h2><p cl